    "Cost": 10476661,
    "UIName": "Predator 1",
    "Id": "mechdef_predator_PCA-1",
    "Name": "Predator 1",
    "Details": "Roughly a third of the Predator's mass is consumed by two LB 10-X Autocannons. These have ample ammunition for most Clan Trials and usually stock both cluster and slug rounds. They are supported by a pair of ER Medium Lasers and paired ER Small Lasers. Not only can the lasers keep the symmetrical design in the fight after its autocannon ammunition runs out, they do not create a burden on the 'Mech's ability to control heat under normal circumstances. Ten double heat sinks is all the Predator needs to keep its heat in check.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Advanced Optics</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.12</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_predator"
  },
